{"title":"Coffee & Conversation @ Sheppard Yonge Sheppard Centre","startsAt":"2026-10-07T13:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-07T15:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Join us for a casual coffee meet-up where we can share stories, and enjoy great conversation in a relaxed atmosphere.\nThis is a perfect opportunity to connect with members of the group, build friendships, and be part of our growing community. Whether you’re new to the group or have been with us for a while, this is a friendly, welcoming space for everyone.\n\n**Event:** Social Gathering for both men and women\n**Location:** Yonge Sheppard Centre - 4841 Yonge St, North York, ON\n\n**Arrival Time:** 1:30-2pm\n**End Time**: Anytime\n\nBring a smile and great conversation and let's make it a fun, easygoing get together.\n\nAttendance - Must confirm with Host if joining by msg or comment.","venue":{"name":"Sheppard Center (Yonge Sheppard Subway) Food Court (lower level)","address":"4841 Yonge St., Toronto, ON, Toronto","lat":43.76226,"lng":-79.41079,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Authentic Friendships Language Exchange","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/5/8/8/highres_533481896.jpeg"}